#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House2/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House2_Text_HiddenPowersArousedByNature"
msgid ""
"People… POKéMON…\p"
"Their hidden powers are aroused by\n"
"living in natural environments…$"
msgstr ""
"人……还有宝可梦……\p"
"生活在大自然中，\n"
"就能唤醒他们隐藏的力量……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House2/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House2_Text_CoinInWhichHand"
msgid ""
"Let this old woman see if your hidden\n"
"power has awoken…\p"
"I hold a coin in my hand.\p"
"Now, tell me, have I palmed it in\n"
"the right hand? Or in the left?$"
msgstr ""
"让老婆婆我来看看，\n"
"你隐藏的力量是否已经觉醒了吧……\p"
"我手里握着一枚硬币。\p"
"好了，告诉我，\n"
"硬币是藏在右手里呢？还是左手里？$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House2/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House2_Text_CorrectTryAgainWhichHand"
msgid ""
"Oh! Yes, correct!\p"
"We shall try again.\p"
"In which hand have I palmed the coin?\n"
"The right or left?$"
msgstr ""
"哦！没错，猜对了！\p"
"我们再来一次。\p"
"硬币藏在哪只手里呢？右手还是左手？$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House2/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House2_Text_CorrectTryAgainWhichHand2"
msgid ""
